and are trained to both reconstruct their iputs and align the latent representations of images and their corresponding captions.

Instead, the ``unified auto-encoder'' (UAE) trains
an encoder (image-ot-text model, ``understanding'' module) and a decoder
(text-to-image model, ``generation'' module)
