  G. Luo et al.
\end{book}
With interventional data ($I_x \to X$ and/or $I_Y \to Y$), it is possible to distinguish between
\[
\begin{tikzpicture}[>=stealth,xscale=1,yscale=1,inner sep=2pt,outer sep=1pt,baseline=0]
  \begin{scope}[shift={(0,0)}]
    \node (IX) at (0,1) {$I_X$};
