Non-exponential distribution:
\begin{align*}
  \dot S &= - \beta SI \\
  I &= I_0 + \int_0^t - \dot S(t-s) P(s) ds 
\end{align*}
Infectivity could depend on the age of the infection.
Parameter estimation.
Seasonal transmission rate:
the timing of vaccination or treatment is important --
too late and the number of infected people can actually increase...
