\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item Cross-immunity from previous outbreaks;
\item Pandemic (new subtype): multiple epidemic waves (perhaps simply due to seasonal effects;
  the second wave can be absent/smaller/larger -- if there were too few recovered people from the first wave).
\item Age profile
\item Contact network estimates + simulations
\item Spatial spread
\item Quarantine and isolation: no reliable assessment of ther efficacy;
  can drastically change the dynamics of the epidemic (e.g., oscillations).
\end{compactitem}

