  L. D'Agostino McGowan (2022)
\end{book}
Sensitivity analysis answers the question
``how strong should a missing confounder be to change the sign of $\E\bigl[Y | \text{do}(T=1)\bigr]$?''

R implementation in \texttt{tipr}.

