  \emph{NeuralFactors: a novel factor learning approach to generative modeling of equities}\\
  A. Gopal
\end{book}
Train a VAE to forecast future stock returns from current stock characteristics
\begin{align*}
  \text{stock}_{it} & \longmapsto \alpha_{it} , \beta_{it} , \sigma_{it} , \nu_{it} \\
  z_{t+1} &\sim T( \mu_z , \sigma_z , \nu_z ) \\
  r_{i, t+1 } &\sim T( \alpha_{it} + \beta_{it}^\top z_{t+1} , \sigma_{it} , \nu_{it} )
\end{align*}
and use it for
synthetic data,
covariance estimation,
risk analysis,
portfolio construction.

A T-SNE embedding of the $\beta_i$ reveals industrial sectors.

