\emph{Gated GCNs} use GRU in the depth dimension.

GraphGPS alternates MPNN layers with global attention layers.

The \emph{turbulence index} (of the market, at a given data)
is the Mahalanobis distance to the average return vector.

The structure of the supply chain graph is not useful in forecasting future (monthly) returns,
