\begin{book}
  \emph{LLaMA-adapter: efficient fine-tuning of language models with zero-init attention}\\
  R. Zhang et al.
\end{book}
Fine-tune LLMs by learning a prompt prefix,
not as tokens,
but directly in the latent space,
not in the first layer, but in higher layers,
