GraphGym is (was?) a descriptive Python library for GNNs,
built on top of \texttt{PyG},
to explore the design space of GNNs:
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item BatchNorm (yes/no);
\item Dropout (0, 0.3, 0.6);
