Dynamic programming, \ie, algorithms of the form
\[ d[x] \leftarrow \operatorname*{Aggregate}_{ y \in \text{Expand}(x) } \bigl[
  \text{score}\bigl( d[y] , d[x] \bigr)
  \bigr] \]
are very similar to GNNs.
This similarity can be formalized.
