  \emph{Estimating missing data in temporal streams using multi-directional\\ recurrent neural networks}\\
  J. Yoon et al. (2017)
\end{book}
M-RNN first interpolates the missing values with a bidirectional RNN,
separately for each time series,
then refines the imputed values with a cross-sectional fully-connected network.
