\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Big Bird: transformers for longer sequences}\\
  M. Zaheer et al.
\end{book}
BigBird makes transformers more scalable by combining:
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item Moving window attention;
\item Sparse (random) attention -- random graphs are good approximations of complete graphs;
\item Global attention, either allowing a few random tokens to attend to all other tokens,
  or by adding a few \textsc{cls} tokens.
\end{compactitem}

