\emph{Residual flows} use a similar idea.
\begin{align*}
  \begin{pmatrix} h_1 \\ h_2 \end{pmatrix}
  &\longmapsto
  \begin{pmatrix} h'_1 \\ h'_2 \end{pmatrix}
  = \begin{pmatrix} h_1 +f_1(h_2) \\ h_2 + f_2(h_1') \end{pmatrix} \\
  \begin{pmatrix} h'_1 - f_1(h_2) \\ h_2' - f_2(h_1') \end{pmatrix}
  &\longmapsfrom
  \begin{pmatrix} h_1 \\ h_2 \end{pmatrix}
\end{align*}
