\begin{book}
  \emph{ChatGPT informed graph neural network\\ for stock movement prediction}\\
  Z. Chen
\end{book}
ChatGPT for named entity recognition (NER) and sentiment extraction.
(Also add stock embeddings from a co-mention graph, and finish with an LSTM.)
  
