Decompose the forecasts (and the performance)
of a forward-return predicting model
(and the corresponding long-short decile portfolio) into:
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item Linear marginal,
\item Nonlinear marginal,
\item Interactions.
\end{compactitem}
The nonlinear marginal part has little predictive power.
  
