\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{WarpedGANSpace:\\ finding non-linear RBF paths\\ in GAN latent space}\\
  C. Tzelepis et al.
\end{book}
To find interpretable paths in the latent space of a GAN, without supervision,
