\end{book}
The optimization of an overparametrized model does not end in any parameter achieving a zero training loss:
the choice of optimization algorithm (and of hyperparameters) directs training towards a particular solution;
for a deep \emph{linear} model, gradient descent leads to a low-rank solution.

\nextbook
