\end{book}
Forecast future stock returns from:
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item Stock features,
\item Known ``concepts'' (sectors, industries, regions, etc.),
\item Unknown concepts (initialize them with stock embeddings;
  link each stock to the nearest concept, excluding its own;
  discard unlinked concepts).
\end{compactitem}
The GNNs (graph neural networks) are applied to the bipartite stock-concept graphs.
