  D. Ardia et al. (2021)
\end{book}
To estimate the ``abnormal tone'' present in news
(\emph{news contextualize information}):
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item Compute the tone of the news;
\item Subtract the average for other companies in the universe;
\item Aggregate around events;
\item Remove the effeect of $B/P$, size, and earnings call tone.
\end{compactitem}

