\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Spectral temporal graph neural network\\ for multivariate time series forecasting}\\
  D. Cao et al. (2021)
\end{book}
To forecast multivariate time series, stack the following layers:
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item GRU: $X \mapsto R$;
\item \emph{Correlation layer}, \ie, self-attention
  \[ W = \text{Softmax}\left( \dfrac{ Q K' }{ \sqrt d } \right), \quad Q = R W_1, \quad K = R W_2 ; \]
  use the attention matrix $W$ as a graph incidence (or weight) matrix in the next layer;
\item Graph Fourier transform, independently for each component; 
\item 1-dimensional convolution; 
\item Gated linear unit: $\text{GLU}(a,b) = a \odot \sigma(b)$;
\item (Repeat several times)
\item Fully-connected layer. 
\end{compactitem}

