Managerial skill can be measured from the residuals of a Cahart 4-factor regression.
Allow non-constant regression coefficients
by estimating them (with the generalized method of moments, GMM)
from some covariate,
e.g., the 3-month lagged factor loadings
(computed from portfolio weights and (constant) constituent factor exposure).

[One could also use a Kalman filter.]
  
