\begin{book}
  \emph{New methods for generating synthetic equivalents of real social networks}\\
  D. Xu et al. (2018)
\end{book}
Generate a random network with overlapping communities
by assigning each node to a random number of random communities
and connecting all the nodes in each community.
Prune and/or rewire if desired.

