\textbf{7.} % Chapter 7 Probabilistic sequence modeling (Kalman, HMM, particle filters) (state space models)
%% Mixture model: the hidden state is iid
%% HMM: the hidden state is Markov
%% Forward: F_t(s) = P[ s_t = s, y_{1:t ]
%% backward: B_t(s) = P[ y_{t+1 : T} | s_t = s ]
%% Forward-backward algorithm (Baum-Welch)
%% - Viterbi algorithm
