\textbf{9.} \emph{Transformers} are stacked attention layers
(no RNN, no CNN), with \emph{positional encoding} and \emph{multihead attention}.
BERT is a bidirectional masked language model;
GPT2 is unidirectional;
MuseNet is unidirectional and uses a \emph{sparse transformer}.

