\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Perception and action\\ from generative models of physics}\\
  K. Smith
  (NeurIPS 2019)
\end{book}
Perception is inverse optics informed by dynamics.

\[
\begin{tikzpicture}[>=stealth,xscale=2.5,yscale=1,inner sep=2pt, outer sep=1pt]
  \node (W0) at (0,1) {World$_t$};
  \node (W1) at (1,1) {World$_{t+1}$};
