\draw[|->] (2,-.7) -- node[auto,pos=.5,inner sep = 1pt] {\footnotesize encoder} (0,-.7);
\end{tikzpicture}
\]

\emph{Generative adversarial networks} (GAN) combine a generator with a discriminator.

Neural autoregressive networks reuse their features.

