\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Time series modeling with undecimated fully convolutional neural networks} \\
  R. Mittelman
\end{book}
Remove the max-pooling and upsampling layers from the FCN,
but use ``upsampled filters'' instead
(\ie, replace an FCN filter $F$ with with 
$F \otimes \mathbf{1}_{k\times k}$:
it is larger, but has the same number of parameters).

