\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Self-normalizing neural networks} \\
  G. Klambauer
\end{book}
No batch normalization is needed for the activation function 
\[
\text{selu}(x) = \lambda \left\{
\begin{array}{ll}
  x & \text{if } x > 0 \\
  \alpha ( e^x - 1 ) & \text{if } x \leq 0.
\end{array}
\right. 
\]

\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Aggregated residual transformations\\ for deep neural networks} \\
  S. Xie et al.
\end{book}
Put the non-linearity (purple) before or after aggregating.
\[
