\begin{book}
  \emph{Cross-stitch networks for multi-task learning} \\
  I. Misra et al.
\end{book}
When using neural nets for different tasks on the same input, one needs to choose when to split the two networks.
\[
\begin{tikzpicture}[
  >=stealth,yscale=.5,xscale=1,
  neuron/.style={draw,thick,inner sep=0pt,text width=4pt, text height = 15pt}
