\[ y = \alpha_1 x_1 + \alpha_2 x_2, \qquad \alpha_1 ^ p + \alpha_2 ^p = 1, \quad p \geq 1, \]
are between residual gates ($p=\infty$, $\alpha_1 = \alpha_2 = 1$)
and highway gates ($p=1$).

