\begin{book}
  \emph{Layer normalization} \\
  J.L. Ba et al.
\end{book}
Batch normalization normalizes the output of a single neuron within a mini-batch; 
\emph{layer normalization} normalizes the outputs of all neurons in a layer, for a single training case;
it is applicable to RNNs.
