\]

\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Semi-supervised learning with ladder networks} \\
  A. Rasmus et al. (2016)
\end{book}

A ladder network is a (denoising) auto-encoder
that tries to reconstruct, not only the input, 
but all the intermediate reconstructions. 

\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Binary embeddings\\ with structured hashed projections} \\
  A. Choromanska et al. 
\end{book}
Pseudo-random projections, with a structured matrix (circulant, Toeplitz, etc.)
\[
\left(\!\!\!  
