  \emph{Fractional-parabolic deformations\\ with sinh-acceleration} \\
  S. Levendorski\u i
\end{book}
Some integrals can be computed using: 
\begin{compactitem}[--]
\item A fractional-parabolic deformation, \ie, by replacing an integral over $\RR$ with an integral over $\sigma \exp[ \alpha \log ( 1 + i \RR ) ]$:
\(
\begin{tikzpicture}[xscale=.3,yscale=.2,>=stealth,baseline=-1mm]
\draw[blue!50,line width = .8ex] (-1,0) -- (1,0);
\draw[thick] (-1,0) -- (1,0);
\draw[thick] (0,-1) -- (0,1);
\end{tikzpicture}
\longmapsto
\begin{tikzpicture}[xscale=.1,yscale=.05,>=stealth,baseline=-1mm]
\draw[blue!50,line width = .5ex]
(-3,-4)--(-2.202,-3.579)--(-1.493,-3.158)--(-0.873,-2.737)--(-0.341,-2.316)--(0.102,-1.895)--(0.457,-1.474)--(0.723,-1.053)--(0.9,-0.632)--(0.989,-0.211)--(0.989,0.211)--(0.9,0.632)--(0.723,1.053)--(0.457,1.474)--(0.102,1.895)--(-0.341,2.316)--(-0.873,2.737)--(-1.493,3.158)--(-2.202,3.579)--(-3,4);
\draw[thick] (-3,0) -- (1,0);
\draw[thick] (0,-4) -- (0,4);
\end{tikzpicture}
\)
\item Sinh acceleration: 
\begin{align*}
  \int_\RR f(x) dx &= 
  \int_\RR f( \sinh y ) \cosh y \, dy \\
  &\approx \sum_{ \va{n} \leq N } f( \sinh n ) \cosh n
\end{align*}
\end{compactitem}

