  \draw[thick,->] (P43) -- (P53);
  \draw[thick,->] (P43) -- (P54);
\end{tikzpicture}
\]
In a \emph{bufferfly} network,
the nodes are arranged in a hypercube; 
in step $k$, the nodes communicate with their neighbours along dimension $k$.
