C++ template library implementing algorithms
 for discrete graphical models
(loopy belief propagation,
sequential tree reweighted belief propagation,
graph cut, etc.), 
\ie, given a factor graph 
and a semiring 
$(\Omega, \otimes, 1, \oplus, 0)$,
computing 
$\bigoplus_x \bigodot_F \phi_F( x_{\text{neigh}(x)} )$; 
examples include 
\[
\begin{array}{lll}
\text{Optimization}
& ( \RR, +, 0, \text{min}, \infty ) 
%& \displaystyle \min_x \sum_F \phi_F( x_{N(F)} )
\\
\text{Marginalization}
& ( \RR^+, \cdot, 1, +, 0 ) 
%& \displaystyle \sum_x \prod_F \phi_F( x_{N(F)} )
\\
\text{Constraint satisfaction} 
& ( \{0,1\}, \wedge, 1, \vee, 0 ) .
%& \displaystyle \bigvee_x \bigwedge_F \phi_F( x_{N(F)} )
\end{array}
\]

\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{MPPack:\\ a scalable C++ machine learning library} \\
  R.R Curtin et al. (2012)
