  J. Sulaeman and C. Wei (2013)
\end{book}
Non-shareholder institutional observers improve
corporate governance 
(and liquidity, cost of capital, information diffusion).
It can be measured by the assets under management 
of institutional investors 
located in the region 
(US state) where the firm is headquartered.

