Bitcoin's \emph{perfect ledger} of all transactions
to model the evolution of 
  volume, 
  price, 
  number of transactions
    (with a distinction between hot (casinos) 
    and cold (real economy) wallets),
  search frequency (Google trend),
  money supply
with a VAR model and impulse-response plots.

