%% EMD
%%

\nextbook
\begin{book}
  \emph{Empirical mode decomposition\\ of financial data}\\
  K. Drakakis (2008)
\end{book}
An intrinsic mode function (IMF) is a continuous function
with positive maxima and negative minima,
\ie, a function that oscillates
(e.g., 
