\nextbook 

\begin{book}
  \emph{Rewriting history}\\
  A. Ljungqvist et al. (2006)
\end{book}

Some estimates in the IBES database are anonynized (when the analysts
ask for it). You would expect that: either all the estimates of an
analyst are anonymized, or only the most recent (so that only his
